        },
        {
          "text": "UJehova wathi kimi: “Bheka, sengiqalile ukunikela uSihoni nezwe lakhe phambi kwakho; qalani ukulidla, ukuze lidle ilifa lelizwe lakhe.",
          "type": "text",
